<section id="course-github-repository" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="course-github-repository">Course GitHub Repository</h2>
<p>The teaching team has created a <a href="https://github.com/GatorAIM/gms6803-clinical-data-science">GitHub repository</a> for the course to share course materials, sample scripts, and other resources</p>
</section>
<section id="training-resources-from-uf-research-computing" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="training-resources-from-uf-research-computing">Training Resources from UF Research Computing</h2>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://docs.rc.ufl.edu/training/new_user_training/">HiperGator New User Training</a></li>
<li>Once the New User Training is completed, students are recommended to check out additional trainings on this page - <a href="https://docs.rc.ufl.edu/training/HiPerGator_training/">HiperGator Training</a></li>
<li>UF Research Computing also offers <a href="https://practicumai.org">Practicum AI</a> training module</li>
</ul>
</section>
<section id="questions-or-concerns" class="level2">
